      "value": "I have experienced this on AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT rarely with water in spring/summer 2025 in VRChat only, with an unspecified driver version (from Windows Update). The issue has gone away entirely for me after switching graphics hardware to NVIDIA RTX 50-series, and I've not seen it once with NVIDIA graphics ever since summer 2025.\n\nThe issue was also more reproducible with personal mirrors for me and standing in specific parts of a world (unspecified), although it could also occur without.",
